  "details": "As the title says, I want an option in the configuration file to save the Steadycam state between sessions.\n\nThe main benefit would be for people who like to clip their game and sometimes forget to set it on, making some footage unusable.\n\nThe main drawback would be people turning it on and forgetting about it, affecting the performance of the player's game. However, that is mitigated by the very nature of the config file as that takes some effort to create it and input the correct string to make it work.",
